note right of PipelineAdapter
  Adapter (Phase 09): translates the pipeline's analysis,
  candle, and account dicts into domain objects.
  bullish/bearish/ranging -> uptrend/downtrend/ranging;
  BOS -> BreakOfStructure, CHoCH -> ChangeOfCharacter.
  Used by tools/trade_plan/build_trade_plan.py with TradePlanBuilder.
end note

