' ---------- Notes ----------

note as AssociationLinks
  Arrows are one-way object references in the arrow direction.
  CurrencyPair -- BacktestResult is two-way: each result holds its pair,
  and the pair holds its results in a private list (FR4).
  Collections (private typed lists, getters return tuples):
  BacktestResult._setups, CurrencyPair._backtests, Account._trades.
  Deliberately one-way: CurrencyPair to TradeSetup, Candle, SwingPoint,
  and TimeframeAnalysis; Account to Order and TradePlan.
  Signal holds four named references, not a collection.
  Timeframe is an enumeration value held by Candle, SwingPoint,
  and TimeframeAnalysis, and returned by Signal and TradePlan.
end note
AssociationLinks .. CurrencyPair

