note as ValidationRules
  Validation rules. Each violation raises ValueError.
  Pair name: OANDA format AAA_BBB, two different currencies.
  TradeSetup, BacktestResult, Candle, SwingPoint, TimeframeAnalysis:
    pair is a CurrencyPair.
  CurrencyPair: at least 2 (high, low) tuple points;
    prices finite numbers > 0; high >= low.
  CurrencyPair.pip_value_per_lot: price finite number > 0;
    cross pair rejected (FR9).
  CurrencyPair.add_backtest: a BacktestResult for this pair (same object),
    not already held, not dated earlier than the latest. remove_backtest: must be held.
  rank_pairs: each item a CurrencyPair; no pair (same object) twice.
  TradeSetup: direction is a TradeDirection; prices finite numbers > 0.
  BuyDirection: stop loss < entry < take profit (FR2).
  SellDirection: take profit < entry < stop loss (FR2).
  BacktestResult: test_date is a date.
  BacktestResult.add_setup: a TradeSetup on the same pair (same object),
    not already held. remove_setup: must be held.
  Candle: complete is True; timeframe is a Timeframe; time is a datetime;
    prices finite numbers > 0; high >= low; low <= open <= high;
    low <= close <= high; volume whole number >= 0 (FR6).
  SwingPoint: label HH, HL, LH, or LL; price finite number > 0 (FR7).
  BreakOfStructure: breaks HH (bullish) or LL (bearish).
  ChangeOfCharacter: breaks LH (bullish) or HL (bearish).
  StructureEvent: bullish close > swing price; bearish close < swing price.
  TimeframeAnalysis: trend uptrend, downtrend, or ranging;
    latest event is a StructureEvent or None, on the same CurrencyPair
    object and Timeframe as the analysis.
  Signal: m1, m5, h1, h4 are analyses on M1, M5, H1, H4 for the same
    CurrencyPair object; min score whole number 1 to 4 (FR8).
  Account: non-empty ID; balance > 0; currency AAA; environment
    "practice" (FR5); 0 < risk percent <= 2 (FR9).
  Account.add_trade: a Trade whose order is for this account (same object),
    not already held, and no other trade recorded for that order.
    remove_trade: must be held. close_trade: open trade held and open;
    closed trade a win or loss for the same order, not held.
  TradePlan: signal is valid; USD account; reward-to-risk to TP1, rounded
    to 2 decimals, >= 2 (FR2); TP2 beyond TP1; lot size >= 0.01 in steps of 0.01;
    pair has a pip value (no cross pair); risk amount, rounded to cents,
    <= account max risk amount (FR9).
  Order: account is the plan's account (same object) and practice;
    confirmed is True (FR10).
  Trade: outcome win, loss, or open; open has no exit price;
    win or loss has an exit price > 0; a win has R multiple > 0
    and a loss R multiple < 0 (FR11).
end note
@enduml
